RoFacto: Robot-Factored World Models via Robot Rendering
Copyright 2026 RoFacto contributors.

This distribution adapts components from Wan2.1 / VACE, VideoX-Fun,
Hugging Face Diffusers, CogVideo, RIFLEx, TeaCache, OpenAI CLIP, OpenCLIP,
LoRA, lora-diffusion, kohya_ss, PRoPE / HY-WorldPlay's MIT-licensed PRoPE
module, PyRoki, Franka Panda / example-robot-data, and robosuite.
Original notices in the source files and licenses/ are retained.
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for component-level attribution.

The RoFacto adaptations add robot-render/depth conditioning, data loading,
training/inference integration, geometry preprocessing, and checkpoint tools.
No base-model weights, private demonstrations or third-party robot mesh files
are included. External dependencies and weights retain their own licenses.
